Reset Your Password via the Self-Service Portal
Purpose
Employees who forget their password can restore access in minutes through the self-service portal, without opening a helpdesk ticket.
Skipping the portal and calling the helpdesk directly adds ticket volume and delays access longer than the self-service flow.
Procedure
Inputs
Company email address or employee ID
Access to your registered mobile phone or backup email, for the verification code
A modern web browser (Chrome, Edge, or Safari)
Steps
Step 1: Sign-in page opened
Navigation: Browser address bar → passwordreset.corp.example.com
Enter your company email address in the box, then select Next. ➡️ Trouble signing in? See the [IT Help Center](https://support.microsoft.com/en-US/accounts-billing/manage/reset-a-forgotten-microsoft-account-password).

